THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL AND ATTRIBUTION

This repository's CODE is Apache-2.0. The following inputs carry their own
terms and are NOT redistributed here:

* Base model — Qwen3-0.6B-Base (Alibaba Cloud), Apache-2.0.
* Training-data teacher — Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct (Alibaba Cloud), Apache-2.0.
* Agronomy corpus — 56 field manuals from FAO, IITA, ICRISAT, AfricaRice,
  ILRI, CABI PlantwisePlus, WorldVeg, ICRAF, WOCAT and national extension
  services. Only extracted text passages are indexed for offline retrieval;
  the source PDFs are not redistributed. Each document, its publisher and its
  licence note are recorded in training/corpus_sources.json.
* Wolof agricultural speech — the Kallaama corpus (Gauthier, Ndiaye & Guissé,
  2024; Orange Innovation / Jokalante / École Polytechnique de Thiès, funded by
  Lacuna Fund), licensed CC-BY 4.0. Attribution is required and is given here
  and in REPORT.md.
* Replay data — ARC (AI2) and SmolTalk (HuggingFaceTB), used under their
  respective licences.

The competition submission template and profiler published by the Africa Deep
Tech Foundation are GPLv3. This repository is an independent implementation and
does not incorporate their source; it only consumes the profiler as an external
measurement tool.

NO WARRANTY FOR AGRICULTURAL OR VETERINARY ADVICE. This software produces
machine-generated guidance that has not been certified by a licensed agronomist
or veterinarian. It is an aid to a human decision-maker, not a substitute for
professional advice. See the Limitations section of REPORT.md.
